Here's a dramatic, cinematic transformation scene built with Canvas animation and particle effects:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Transformation Scene</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #0a0608;
    --accent: #c41e1e;
    --glow: #ff2244;
    --text: #e8d5d5;
    --muted: #5a3a3a;
  }

  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    background: var(--bg);
    overflow: hidden;
    font-family: 'Creepster', cursive;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    height: 100vh;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Creepster&family=Special+Elite&display=swap');

  canvas {
    display: block;
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
  }

  .ui-overlay {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 30px;
    z-index: 10;
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .transform-btn {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b0000, #c41e1e, #8b0000);
    border: 2px solid #ff2244;
    color: #ffe0e0;
    font-family: 'Creepster', cursive;
    font-size: 22px;
    padding: 14px 36px;
    cursor: pointer;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    border-radius: 4px;
    transition: all 0.3s;
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255,34,68,0.6);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(196,30,30,0.4), inset 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
  }

  .transform-btn:hover {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a00000, #e02020, #a00000);
    box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(255,34,68,0.7), inset 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .transform-btn:active {
    transform: scale(0.97);
  }

  .transform-btn:disabled {
    opacity: 0.4;
    cursor: not-allowed;
    transform: none;
  }

  .reset-btn {
    background: rgba(30,15,15,0.8);
    border: 1px solid #5a3a3a;
    color: #a08080;
    font-family: 'Special Elite', cursive;
    font-size: 14px;
    padding: 10px 24px;
    cursor: pointer;
    border-radius: 4px;
    transition: all 0.3s;
  }

  .reset-btn:hover {
    border-color: #c41e1e;
    color: #e8d5d5;
  }
